        "Description": "Good Morning 47 \r\rwe have located the Inquisitor. Apparently the mad in love, crazy Hector Delgado is the perfect cover for the most dangerous member of Blue Blood, who was even able to follow you in Miami. There is a problem: Everyone on the grounds is a part of project Epsilon. All of them have had a chip installed in there systems, making them and Blue Blood&apos;s leaders all connected. If one goes down, all of Blue Blood will be alerted, same goes if they spot you or find a body.\r\rGood luck 47",
